{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里有股说不清的劲，身体也绷着，却不知道自己在等什么、该往哪儿使力。\",\n      \"key\": \"在等什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕由着事情照旧就是认了它们本该如此，也怕投入后失去别的东西，硬撑着不倒下，心里却想歇一歇。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕投入后失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的感觉一回来，他暂时觉得自己有路可走，身体先松动了，可他仍说不清究竟想要什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"有路可走\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一遍遍找理由，刚觉得能信了，舍不得又冒出来，连舍不得什么都说不清，为自己非得想透才敢动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才敢动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留无名推动力、身体紧绷和不知所等，删去直说的向前冲动，避免与后两条重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"恢复并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回由着事情照旧就等于认了它们本该如此的判断，说明他为何硬撑，同时保留想歇息和怕投入后失去的两难。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补入并精简\",\n      \"why\": \"补足B4中熟悉感暂时带来方向、身体先于念头松动的变化；删去过去无法回来的结论，避免复述珠子，也不再重复向前的劲。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留寻找理由、刚要相信又被不舍打断的循环，以及非得想透才敢动的难堪，不再把同一轮迟疑拆开。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "825ecaf8-22e1-4f89-b94c-2e818582f146", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191755638530Z", "elapsed_seconds": 218.485, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:21:34.140506+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5164d3ee264189495922f614c11ed93723d92a895ead8aad89e83d893204c70", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191755638530Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "364499c60adf47d7d3161db25b43c1836d0b8fe0754139773464a921f2e87e60"}}}
